    },
    {
     "text": "Dunning's penchant for ethnic stereotypes was showcased once again in his comic strip, this time training his sights on Jews. My jaw dropped the first time I saw the title Maggie's Yiddish Moe, which sounds more like the title of a Tijuana Bible than a comic strip for mainstream newspapers. It's pre",
